WEBVTT

00:00:05.405 --> 00:00:06.770
Hey, Tokio.

00:00:07.807 --> 00:00:10.610
Do you know when the food
I eat turns into me?

00:00:10.610 --> 00:00:11.444
Huh?

00:00:11.444 --> 00:00:14.114
What are you talking about?

00:00:14.114 --> 00:00:16.742
Of course it happens
the moment you eat it.

00:00:18.218 --> 00:00:19.953
The moment I eat it?

00:00:19.953 --> 00:00:21.944
Like when it goes into my mouth?

00:00:22.155 --> 00:00:24.680
Or when it goes into my stomach?

00:00:24.891 --> 00:00:25.789
Huh?

00:00:27.927 --> 00:00:30.163
Well, when it's in your mouth...

00:00:30.163 --> 00:00:32.757
...it's pretty much still just food.

00:00:33.299 --> 00:00:35.529
So, maybe when it goes
into your stomach?

00:00:35.835 --> 00:00:37.063
You think?

00:00:38.905 --> 00:00:41.307
There're foods that
come out undigested...

00:00:41.307 --> 00:00:44.140
...after they go through
your stomach.

00:00:46.579 --> 00:00:48.638
Yeah, but...

00:00:49.749 --> 00:00:52.852
Well, maybe it's when the
food gets digested...

00:00:52.852 --> 00:00:55.787
...and absorbed into your body.

00:00:56.389 --> 00:01:00.126
When it gets absorbed
and becomes blood?

00:01:00.126 --> 00:01:01.115
Yeah, that's it.

00:01:01.561 --> 00:01:02.896
Eventually...

00:01:02.896 --> 00:01:04.898
...food becomes blood
and then flesh.

00:01:04.898 --> 00:01:08.629
Then, would you say
that my blood is me?

00:01:09.035 --> 00:01:12.105
If my blood was actually me...

00:01:12.105 --> 00:01:14.841
...and then my blood were to
be transfused into you...

00:01:14.841 --> 00:01:17.139
...does that mean I become you?

00:01:17.544 --> 00:01:18.238
What?

00:01:20.413 --> 00:01:21.481
Let's see...

00:01:21.481 --> 00:01:23.183
Then, what about breath?

00:01:23.183 --> 00:01:23.716
Breath?

00:01:23.716 --> 00:01:24.307
Yeah.

00:01:24.517 --> 00:01:25.040
Breath.

00:01:25.785 --> 00:01:29.656
When I breathe in and
inhale the air around me...

00:01:29.656 --> 00:01:32.292
...the oxygen gets
absorbed into my blood...

00:01:32.292 --> 00:01:33.953
...and that becomes a part of me,
right?

00:01:34.794 --> 00:01:38.898
Then, if I were to exhale and
you were to breathe that in...

00:01:38.898 --> 00:01:41.765
...does that mean
I become you as well?

00:01:43.703 --> 00:01:45.170
Are you all right?

00:01:45.839 --> 00:01:47.841
How could there be
something so ridiculous?

00:01:47.841 --> 00:01:48.675
Why not?

00:01:48.675 --> 00:01:50.210
I mean, think about it.

00:01:50.210 --> 00:01:51.778
Whether it's blood or breath...

00:01:51.778 --> 00:01:55.111
...there's no emotion,
no soul or spirit.

00:01:55.415 --> 00:01:56.382
Soul?

00:01:57.851 --> 00:02:00.285
If that's the case,
where is the soul?

00:02:00.553 --> 00:02:04.421
Well, that's in the brain
or something.

00:02:04.624 --> 00:02:07.559
Then, any part of me other than
my brain is not me?

00:02:07.894 --> 00:02:11.694
My arms, legs, stomach
and heart are not part of me?

00:02:14.367 --> 00:02:15.368
Well, that's...

00:02:15.368 --> 00:02:16.062
That's...?

00:02:16.769 --> 00:02:17.633
That's...

00:02:19.506 --> 00:02:21.235
That's...

00:02:22.809 --> 00:02:27.246
Now, a miracle is about
to be created upon this planet.

00:02:43.229 --> 00:02:44.161
It's begun.

00:02:44.397 --> 00:02:45.887
It's begun?

00:02:46.866 --> 00:02:47.525
Tokio!

00:02:47.734 --> 00:02:48.496
Tokio!

00:02:48.701 --> 00:02:49.395
What's going on?!

00:02:49.602 --> 00:02:50.569
Answer me!

00:03:12.091 --> 00:03:13.285
What...?

00:03:14.894 --> 00:03:15.792
What is this?

00:03:18.831 --> 00:03:19.695
Juna?

00:03:20.366 --> 00:03:21.634
I'm scared, sis...!

00:03:21.634 --> 00:03:23.534
You scaredy cat!

00:03:26.439 --> 00:03:27.807
What's that sound?

00:03:27.807 --> 00:03:28.967
Just hang on!

00:03:33.546 --> 00:03:34.614
Sis!

00:03:34.614 --> 00:03:35.876
Yukari...

00:04:01.507 --> 00:04:04.840
Earth Maiden Arjuna

00:04:05.011 --> 00:04:09.846
Episode 12: The Death of a Nation

00:04:14.153 --> 00:04:16.055
It's bad this way, too.

00:04:16.055 --> 00:04:17.818
W-We've got to get out of here.

00:04:22.428 --> 00:04:23.452
Dad!

00:04:24.097 --> 00:04:24.998
Sayuri!

00:04:24.998 --> 00:04:27.990
Thank God. You're all okay.

00:04:35.275 --> 00:04:36.469
Dad!

00:04:44.917 --> 00:04:45.611
Juna?

00:04:47.720 --> 00:04:48.311
Juna!

00:04:48.521 --> 00:04:49.283
Juna!

00:04:52.492 --> 00:04:54.160
It's hot! It's hot!

00:04:54.160 --> 00:04:55.422
Dad!

00:04:55.628 --> 00:04:56.929
Dad!

00:04:56.929 --> 00:04:58.453
No! Stay back!

00:05:08.708 --> 00:05:09.509
Juna!

00:05:09.509 --> 00:05:11.602
Juna! Come on, Juna!

00:05:29.529 --> 00:05:31.520
One quiet autumn night...

00:05:32.632 --> 00:05:35.001
...one nation...

00:05:35.001 --> 00:05:35.899
...died.

00:05:47.680 --> 00:05:51.548
Because of the landing of
a large number of Raajas...

00:05:51.918 --> 00:05:55.877
...that eat everything
made from petrochemicals...

00:05:56.089 --> 00:05:58.057
...electricity...

00:05:58.257 --> 00:06:02.057
...water and food are gone.

00:06:03.663 --> 00:06:07.064
Japan was destroyed.

00:06:09.635 --> 00:06:12.627
Seven hours later...

00:06:15.708 --> 00:06:16.676
What are you doing?

00:06:16.676 --> 00:06:19.372
Stabilize the output
of the protective barrier!

00:06:19.479 --> 00:06:21.709
Refuse all requests to
support civilian evacuations!

00:06:21.948 --> 00:06:23.882
We don't have the
means to do that!

00:06:23.950 --> 00:06:26.919
Move TI-1 to the
Sacred Ancient Ruins!

00:06:27.387 --> 00:06:30.223
He sure picked a good time
to get ill.

00:06:30.223 --> 00:06:31.417
Useless boy!

00:06:32.058 --> 00:06:33.923
A report from the
analysis section!

00:06:34.293 --> 00:06:35.561
They've detected PDB...

00:06:35.561 --> 00:06:37.530
...or Petrochemical
Decomposition Bacteria...

00:06:37.530 --> 00:06:42.229
...in the air 300 meters
above the damaged area!

00:06:43.202 --> 00:06:44.260
PDB?!

00:06:45.037 --> 00:06:48.241
If that is what has synthesized
with the Raajas and has grown...

00:06:48.241 --> 00:06:49.776
...nevermind lifelines...

00:06:49.776 --> 00:06:51.778
...all of Japan will be annihilated!

00:06:51.778 --> 00:06:52.645
T-3!

00:06:52.645 --> 00:06:55.113
Get in touch with the
government immediately!

00:06:58.217 --> 00:07:01.654
I'm telling you to get in touch
with the other TI psychics!

00:07:01.654 --> 00:07:04.589
There's no need to get
the government's advice!

00:07:05.224 --> 00:07:08.694
Right now we have to hurry and
shut down all nuclear reactors!

00:07:08.694 --> 00:07:12.289
We must prevent a potential
meltdown at all costs!

00:07:13.366 --> 00:07:14.333
Commander Onizuka.

00:07:14.333 --> 00:07:17.131
I have a connection with
the United States branch.

00:07:21.140 --> 00:07:23.108
PDB, huh?

00:07:23.676 --> 00:07:26.873
No, TI-2 is still unconscious.

00:07:27.480 --> 00:07:30.347
We can't put her into action
at the moment.

00:07:30.850 --> 00:07:32.579
Uh, right...

00:07:36.556 --> 00:07:39.252
I offer my deepest sympathy
to the victims.

00:07:43.095 --> 00:07:43.993
We have a casualty here!

00:07:44.163 --> 00:07:45.565
Please clear the way!

00:07:45.565 --> 00:07:48.466
You've got to be strong
for your surviving grandchildren.

00:07:51.704 --> 00:07:54.400
Hey, where did Dad go?

00:07:54.807 --> 00:07:56.240
When's he coming back?

00:08:11.057 --> 00:08:12.058
Wh-What the...?!

00:08:12.058 --> 00:08:14.527
Plastics and vinyl are no good.

00:08:14.527 --> 00:08:17.196
Rubber, adhesives,
and even syringes...

00:08:17.196 --> 00:08:18.595
Everything.

00:08:18.664 --> 00:08:21.567
All products made from
petrochemicals have corroded.

00:08:21.567 --> 00:08:23.865
What's going to happen
from now on?

00:08:33.279 --> 00:08:36.983
D-Don't tell me this is the
bacteria that was developed...

00:08:36.983 --> 00:08:38.075
...at my dad's company.

00:08:38.584 --> 00:08:42.577
Second Day...

00:08:59.171 --> 00:09:02.106
Third Day...

00:09:27.967 --> 00:09:30.663
Fourth Day...

00:09:44.650 --> 00:09:45.985
Fifth Day...

00:09:45.985 --> 00:09:49.318
Fifth Day...

00:09:49.889 --> 00:09:52.016
...this is the provisional government.

00:09:52.391 --> 00:09:56.362
There is a possibility that you
have been contaminated by PDB.

00:09:56.362 --> 00:09:58.798
Please withdraw quickly
from the area.

00:09:58.798 --> 00:10:01.867
Until we have developed a way
to neutralize the PDB...

00:10:01.867 --> 00:10:04.461
...passage through this area
is forbidden.

00:10:04.770 --> 00:10:07.603
Evacuees from Metropolitan
Tokyo and nearby prefectures...

00:10:08.574 --> 00:10:11.668
Sixth Day...

00:10:12.011 --> 00:10:12.978
The water...

00:10:13.179 --> 00:10:13.873
That water...!

00:10:34.500 --> 00:10:36.832
Eighth Day...

00:10:38.938 --> 00:10:41.031
Ninth Day...

00:10:43.643 --> 00:10:46.578
Tenth Day...

00:10:53.653 --> 00:10:54.984
Mom...

00:10:55.388 --> 00:10:56.320
Tokio...

00:10:57.757 --> 00:11:01.659
Eleventh Day...

00:11:10.436 --> 00:11:14.463
Why am I in a place like this?

00:11:22.114 --> 00:11:23.308
My strength...

00:11:33.926 --> 00:11:35.257
I don't understand English.

00:11:38.364 --> 00:11:40.700
People living in the
large coastal cities...

00:11:40.700 --> 00:11:42.935
...are facing acute shortages...

00:11:42.935 --> 00:11:45.604
...in conditions for which rescue
and aid cannot be provided.

00:11:45.604 --> 00:11:46.605
N-No way!

00:11:46.605 --> 00:11:47.473
Moreover...

00:11:47.473 --> 00:11:49.041
...due to the corrosion
of containers...

00:11:49.041 --> 00:11:51.043
...fertilizers and harmful chemicals...

00:11:51.043 --> 00:11:53.279
...have contaminated
the water supply.

00:11:53.279 --> 00:11:57.306
The refugees are not even able to
rely on a sufficient water supply.

00:11:58.517 --> 00:12:02.578
We will continue our coverage of the
situation in Japan after the break.

00:12:03.989 --> 00:12:07.993
How many diets have you
given up on so far?

00:12:07.993 --> 00:12:09.128
The method most suitable...!

00:12:09.128 --> 00:12:10.930
At a time like this!

00:12:10.930 --> 00:12:12.955
Big Hit - Long Running Musical

00:12:13.799 --> 00:12:15.534
A story of forbidden love.

00:12:15.534 --> 00:12:16.796
Finally coming to Japan!

00:12:17.570 --> 00:12:19.470
Tommy, why did you die?

00:12:20.239 --> 00:12:22.332
Dec. 21:
Advanced tickets go on sale.

00:12:33.052 --> 00:12:33.185
Meriken SD Burger
Slim & Diet

00:12:33.185 --> 00:12:35.955
Meriken SD Burger
Slim & Diet

00:12:35.955 --> 00:12:37.156
Eat as much as you want!
Z ero percent fat, but still tastes like meat!

00:12:37.156 --> 00:12:38.290
Buy 1 Meriken Burger on
a weekday and get another FREE!

00:12:38.290 --> 00:12:39.450
Meriken Burger all the time!

00:12:39.825 --> 00:12:44.262
Earth Maiden Arjuna

00:12:50.503 --> 00:12:52.938
Magnetic anomaly in the
northeastern part of Awaji Island.

00:12:52.938 --> 00:12:54.807
Surpassing 7.5 percent normal level.

00:12:54.807 --> 00:12:58.344
Ground current has been recorded
exceeding 70 times the normal levels.

00:12:58.344 --> 00:13:03.115
Likely due to bio waves of the Raaja
landing in the coastal region.

00:13:03.115 --> 00:13:05.017
It looks like the lay lines
of the Japanese archipelago...

00:13:05.017 --> 00:13:07.884
...have been activated by
resonating with the Raajas.

00:13:08.020 --> 00:13:08.987
Lay lines?

00:13:09.688 --> 00:13:12.124
If the lay lines were to
act up now...

00:13:12.124 --> 00:13:13.626
...not only Japan...

00:13:13.626 --> 00:13:14.888
...but also the world will be...

00:13:15.094 --> 00:13:17.892
Hurry up with the analysis of
the Raajas that have landed.

00:13:18.364 --> 00:13:22.596
We must do whatever we can to
stop it from spreading any further.

00:13:22.835 --> 00:13:27.465
However, if we're not able
to hold back the spread...

00:13:35.748 --> 00:13:39.451
I'm sorry that you have to take
care of an old lady like me.

00:13:39.451 --> 00:13:41.287
It's all right.

00:13:41.287 --> 00:13:44.924
The men are out getting
food supplies right now.

00:13:44.924 --> 00:13:45.913
So, keep your hopes up.

00:14:00.039 --> 00:14:00.806
Let's get out of here!

00:14:00.806 --> 00:14:01.272
Hurry!

00:14:03.309 --> 00:14:11.717
Do not drink! Contaminated Water.

00:14:23.829 --> 00:14:25.023
Aren't you going to eat?

00:14:26.565 --> 00:14:29.134
You were on IV for
over ten days, after all.

00:14:29.134 --> 00:14:31.432
You'll need to eat
and get some nutrition.

00:14:41.380 --> 00:14:42.882
How can you expect me to eat?

00:14:42.882 --> 00:14:43.405
Huh?

00:14:44.083 --> 00:14:47.985
How can everyone munch away
without a thought...

00:14:49.054 --> 00:14:52.023
...when people in Japan
are starving?

00:14:52.725 --> 00:14:54.317
Is that why you're
not eating?

00:14:55.094 --> 00:14:56.695
Mom and Tokio and the others...

00:14:56.695 --> 00:14:59.899
...could be suffering because
there's nothing to eat.

00:14:59.899 --> 00:15:01.833
How can I eat?

00:15:02.534 --> 00:15:06.338
Then, why were you able to eat...

00:15:06.338 --> 00:15:09.136
...when children in Africa
were starving?

00:15:10.643 --> 00:15:13.312
There were children
who died in my arms...

00:15:13.312 --> 00:15:16.372
...because they couldn't
even get a morsel of food.

00:15:36.135 --> 00:15:37.363
How did it go?

00:15:38.470 --> 00:15:39.494
Bad.

00:15:40.439 --> 00:15:43.008
In the city and even
in the back hills...

00:15:43.008 --> 00:15:45.442
...there're monsters
crawling everywhere.

00:15:46.178 --> 00:15:50.012
I was hardly able to find
anything to eat or drink.

00:15:51.383 --> 00:15:52.179
I see.

00:15:53.686 --> 00:15:57.247
It would be nice if it
at least rained a bit.

00:16:00.292 --> 00:16:02.157
It's just as Juna said.

00:16:02.361 --> 00:16:03.089
Huh?

00:16:03.796 --> 00:16:07.425
Cities can stop functioning
all too quickly.

00:16:08.667 --> 00:16:12.159
We can't do anything
without electricity or water.

00:16:14.840 --> 00:16:16.239
It's so true.

00:16:20.412 --> 00:16:21.106
I'm sorry.

00:16:21.680 --> 00:16:22.339
What?

00:16:22.948 --> 00:16:24.973
Why are you apologizing?

00:16:27.386 --> 00:16:28.318
I'm really sorry.

00:16:29.188 --> 00:16:33.818
I mean, it was my father
who developed that PDB.

00:16:35.494 --> 00:16:39.064
If only I was able to
stop my father back then.

00:16:39.064 --> 00:16:40.032
But...

00:16:40.032 --> 00:16:42.568
If I was able to stop my father...

00:16:42.568 --> 00:16:45.560
...the city, and even your father...

00:16:47.306 --> 00:16:49.274
Maybe it's better if I just died.

00:16:54.346 --> 00:16:55.948
Don't ever say that again!

00:16:55.948 --> 00:16:58.007
Don't ever talk
about death like that!

00:16:58.884 --> 00:16:59.618
Ever!

00:16:59.618 --> 00:17:02.212
Don't ever talk like that!

00:17:10.229 --> 00:17:13.596
Anything with form
will certainly be destroyed.

00:17:14.366 --> 00:17:17.436
Just as with the stars
in the night sky...

00:17:17.436 --> 00:17:19.405
...the fate of everything
in this world...

00:17:19.405 --> 00:17:23.307
...is for things to disappear
and then be reborn.

00:17:24.643 --> 00:17:26.678
Cindy...

00:17:26.678 --> 00:17:28.781
...if I am to die...

00:17:28.781 --> 00:17:32.051
...I want you to feed my corpse
to the birds.

00:17:32.051 --> 00:17:32.608
What?

00:17:33.919 --> 00:17:34.476
No.

00:17:35.387 --> 00:17:39.881
I mean, you're definitely,
definitely not going to die.

00:17:43.529 --> 00:17:44.553
I suppose.

00:17:45.130 --> 00:17:46.688
I won't die.

00:17:47.966 --> 00:17:50.803
My body will be eaten
by the birds...

00:17:50.803 --> 00:17:53.772
...and rise up into the sky...

00:17:53.772 --> 00:17:58.436
...and become a part of the wind
and the land of this planet.

00:18:01.447 --> 00:18:02.414
Chris...

00:18:10.789 --> 00:18:11.551
Please!

00:18:12.257 --> 00:18:14.817
Send me back to Japan
right away!

00:18:15.094 --> 00:18:16.261
Branch Director...

00:18:16.261 --> 00:18:18.063
...based on the movement
pattern data...

00:18:18.063 --> 00:18:21.521
...there seems to be a command
structure controlling the Raajas.

00:18:22.201 --> 00:18:24.536
If we use the ability of the TI-2...

00:18:24.536 --> 00:18:26.271
...we should be able
to identify that.

00:18:26.271 --> 00:18:28.762
I've read your report.

00:18:29.341 --> 00:18:33.778
Even we would like very much
for you to go back to Japan.

00:18:34.746 --> 00:18:35.508
Then...

00:18:35.714 --> 00:18:36.882
However...

00:18:36.882 --> 00:18:40.719
...we unfortunately have no way
of sending you back.

00:18:40.719 --> 00:18:42.521
The only safe airports there...

00:18:42.521 --> 00:18:45.456
...have been restricted by the
provisional government.

00:18:45.991 --> 00:18:48.827
They seem to be in
an extreme state of chaos...

00:18:48.827 --> 00:18:52.131
...and they haven't had time
to deal with us.

00:18:52.131 --> 00:18:54.399
In such an unstable situation...

00:18:54.399 --> 00:18:56.468
...it would be very difficult
to send you.

00:18:56.468 --> 00:19:01.599
Basically, we have decided
to quarantine Japan...

00:19:02.608 --> 00:19:04.376
You're going to
quarantine Japan?!

00:19:04.376 --> 00:19:05.001
Huh?

00:19:06.211 --> 00:19:09.442
Does that mean you're going
to let everyone die?!

00:19:20.359 --> 00:19:22.261
Sayuri, what's going on?

00:19:22.261 --> 00:19:25.731
They were at the water tap...

00:19:25.731 --> 00:19:29.001
...and couldn't bear it,
so they drank the water.

00:19:29.001 --> 00:19:31.299
Sayuri! Get it together!

00:19:32.938 --> 00:19:37.309
It seems your little brother
vomited immediately afterwards...

00:19:37.309 --> 00:19:41.678
...but your little sister
drank quite a lot of it.

00:19:42.247 --> 00:19:45.307
If only we had a sedative.

00:19:45.617 --> 00:19:47.019
What...?

00:19:47.019 --> 00:19:49.010
She was fine until
earlier this evening.

00:19:51.723 --> 00:19:54.259
Sayuri, if I die...

00:19:54.259 --> 00:19:57.829
...will I be able to go and see Dad?

00:19:57.829 --> 00:19:59.763
Don't say such a thing!

00:20:05.704 --> 00:20:06.572
Let's go.

00:20:06.572 --> 00:20:08.106
We'll go over the back hills...

00:20:08.106 --> 00:20:10.142
...and on to a city
beyond the mountains.

00:20:10.142 --> 00:20:12.244
If we get over the mountains...

00:20:12.244 --> 00:20:14.246
...I'm sure we can find
medicine and food.

00:20:14.246 --> 00:20:15.581
Yeah, but...

00:20:15.581 --> 00:20:17.883
...there're monsters
in the mountains.

00:20:17.883 --> 00:20:20.152
And even if we get past them,
we'll be chased away...

00:20:20.152 --> 00:20:21.710
...by people with guns!

00:20:22.087 --> 00:20:24.089
But if we stay here...

00:20:24.089 --> 00:20:26.956
...Yukari and even Kimitoshi will...

00:20:28.860 --> 00:20:29.795
You go on.

00:20:29.795 --> 00:20:32.593
We'll look after the boy.

00:20:33.031 --> 00:20:34.132
If you don't go now...

00:20:34.132 --> 00:20:36.368
...it might be too late.

00:20:36.368 --> 00:20:37.436
Now...

00:20:37.436 --> 00:20:40.064
...leave the rest to us
and get going.

00:20:40.405 --> 00:20:41.807
Hey, kid...

00:20:41.807 --> 00:20:45.177
...your big sister and her friend
are going to go take your...

00:20:45.177 --> 00:20:47.412
...little sister away for a while,
all right?

00:20:47.412 --> 00:20:49.243
You're a big boy.

00:21:07.833 --> 00:21:11.436
It seems I underestimated
your TI abilities.

00:21:11.436 --> 00:21:15.007
I never thought you'd break
through my psychic protection.

00:21:15.007 --> 00:21:16.634
You are right.

00:21:17.776 --> 00:21:21.013
The United States government
and S. E. E. D. International HQ...

00:21:21.013 --> 00:21:25.211
...have decided today that Japan
shall be completely quarantined.

00:21:26.084 --> 00:21:27.381
Why's that?!

00:21:31.356 --> 00:21:32.084
Take a look.

00:21:41.667 --> 00:21:45.604
This is the sight of civilization
that humanity has achieved.

00:21:45.604 --> 00:21:49.472
Do you know what it is
that sustains it all?

00:21:49.975 --> 00:21:50.839
It's oil.

00:21:51.410 --> 00:21:53.312
Oil is what provides the
driving power...

00:21:53.312 --> 00:21:56.782
...flowing like blood
to support our civilization.

00:21:56.782 --> 00:22:00.240
Imagine if this were to disappear
in the course of one night.

00:22:02.688 --> 00:22:05.290
We would be terrified
of the dark nights...

00:22:05.290 --> 00:22:07.952
...and have to
live like animals.

00:22:08.193 --> 00:22:11.496
We would have to return to
a prehistoric way of life.

00:22:11.496 --> 00:22:13.832
Are you saying this is
an extreme decision...

00:22:13.832 --> 00:22:16.027
...motivated by the need
to save civilization?

00:22:20.172 --> 00:22:22.708
The rest of humanity will...

00:22:22.708 --> 00:22:26.075
...never forget the noble
sacrifices made by them.

00:22:26.278 --> 00:22:27.438
Noble sacrifices?

00:22:27.913 --> 00:22:30.649
120 million is not just a number.

00:22:30.649 --> 00:22:34.278
Can you bear the burden
of 120 million deaths?

00:22:41.226 --> 00:22:46.254
Will you be responsible for
the remaining 5.9 billion?

00:22:46.465 --> 00:22:47.227
Stop this!

00:22:47.699 --> 00:22:49.462
Who cares about numbers!!

00:22:50.469 --> 00:22:53.404
We've got to go and
save Japan right now!

00:22:53.772 --> 00:22:56.240
We'll do the best that we can.

00:22:56.541 --> 00:23:00.946
At least while there are still
people in Japan that can be saved.

00:23:00.946 --> 00:23:01.935
No.

00:23:03.648 --> 00:23:05.445
I'm going back to Japan!

00:23:09.588 --> 00:23:10.885
I'm going back.

00:23:12.257 --> 00:23:13.121
You fool.

00:23:15.494 --> 00:23:18.463
Are you going to go and
destroy the world with anger?

00:23:19.164 --> 00:23:23.635
Wasn't it your careless actions
that activated the mutant bacteria...

00:23:23.635 --> 00:23:26.195
...and spread the Raaja around?

00:23:26.405 --> 00:23:26.996
What?

00:23:27.739 --> 00:23:28.874
Why...?

00:23:28.874 --> 00:23:31.069
Why do you say it's my fault?

00:23:31.343 --> 00:23:33.311
You don't even understand that.

00:23:33.311 --> 00:23:37.543
It is that ignorance of yours
that brought about this situation.

00:23:38.984 --> 00:23:39.973
Shut up!

00:23:41.386 --> 00:23:44.055
You still haven't learned anything...

00:23:44.055 --> 00:23:46.546
...even though Japan
is being destroyed.

00:23:46.992 --> 00:23:47.659
Shut up!

00:23:47.659 --> 00:23:50.184
Shut up! Shut up!

00:24:00.038 --> 00:24:02.700
Ashura is materializing!

00:24:10.982 --> 00:24:11.850
N-No!

00:24:11.850 --> 00:24:12.908
This way!

00:24:18.023 --> 00:24:19.251
The fool...

00:24:35.707 --> 00:24:36.833
Juna...

00:24:53.925 --> 00:24:54.687
Faster!

00:24:54.893 --> 00:24:56.292
Faster!

00:25:06.104 --> 00:25:09.073
TI-2 and Ashura
response detected!

00:25:09.307 --> 00:25:11.476
Approaching the Kansai area
at high speed...

00:25:11.476 --> 00:25:12.875
...across the Pacific Ocean!

00:25:13.945 --> 00:25:15.344
TI-2 and Ashura?!

00:25:18.416 --> 00:25:20.714
There's abnormal energy
from the Sacred Ancient Ruins!

00:25:20.886 --> 00:25:22.080
From the Sacred Ancient Ruins?!

00:25:33.465 --> 00:25:34.329
Chris!

00:25:34.533 --> 00:25:36.000
Chris!

00:25:50.115 --> 00:25:51.082
Tokio...
